# Never send local secrets, state, demos or build artefacts to the Docker daemon.
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.state.json
**/out
**/*.dem
**/*.dem.*
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.hypothesis
